From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:24:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): data-driven practice library with 100
 unsolved challenges

- Catalog of 100 challenges (34 Easy / 50 Medium / 16 Hard), none solved
- Pagination (10 per page), topic/status/difficulty filters, search, acceptance sort
- Header, progress banner and tab counters derive from the data (no hardcoded 240/48)
- Cmd/Ctrl+K focuses search; empty states; HTML-escaped rendering
- Pair Sum is now #1 (IDE/dashboard labels updated); api.js ids/total derived from data
